.TH SDL_GetGPURendererDevice 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetGPURendererDevice \- Return the GPU device used by a renderer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_GPUDevice * SDL_GetGPURendererDevice(SDL_Renderer *renderer);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I renderer
the rendering context\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the GPU device used by the renderer, or NULL if the renderer is not a GPU renderer; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

